DESCRIPTION:NEW BAND. NEW COCKTAILS. ONE LOUD NIGHT AT BRICK.\nProof of Li
 fe is hitting the Brick stage for the very first time\, and we’re ready 
 to welcome them properly—cold drinks\, live music\, and a crowd that kno
 ws how to have a damn good time.\nOur new August cocktails are officially 
 pouring\, so come find your favorite—or work your way through the lineup
 . We don’t judge. Much.\nKaren kicks off the day behind the bar\, then t
 ags out to Amber and Mel to keep the fresh\, cold drinks flowing and the p
 arty popping all night long.\nCalvin will be in the kitchen serving up the
  good stuff until 10 PM\, so come hungry.\nGrab your crew and come show Pr
 oof of Life what a Brick crowd is all about.\nBrick • Corning\n#BrickCor
 ning #ProofOfLife #LiveMusic #NewBandNight #AugustCocktails #CorningNY #Sa
 turdayNightAtBrick\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0u
 zpj/event/78432950/20260808210000
