DESCRIPTION:The Corning Area Business Alliance is introducing a new event 
 to keep the weekends alive all summer long. Every Sunday in August\, enjoy
  live music and food vendors from 11am to 3pm in Corning's Centerway Squar
 e. Each week\, we will also welcome area nonprofits to help you learn more
  about the Southern Finger Lakes community.\nEvents are free and open to t
 he public thanks to generous sponsorships from:\nAniello's Pizzeria\nThe F
 abric Chicken\nRooted Planning Group\nMarket Street Lofts\nEvent by Cornin
 g Area Business Alliance\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly
 /o9b0uzpj/event/78415581/20260802110000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78415581/20260802110000
