BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Car Meetup & Summer Jam at Park Ave Sports Center
DTSTART:20260809T160000Z
DTEND:20260809T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260809T201414Z
UID:f1264eb7ff3bbb6e6a1bd306cac6ff7564810ef9@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Cars,Music,Games,Family Fun
DESCRIPTION:Park Avenue Car Meetup and Summer Jam!\nGet ready for the ulti
 mate summer afternoon of cool cars\, live tunes\, and great food! Join us 
 at Park Avenue Sports Center for our upcoming Car Meetup and Summer Jam. W
 hether you are a die-hard gearhead or just looking for a fun Sunday outing
  with the family\, there is something here for everyone.\nEvent Details\nD
 ate: Sunday\, August 9th\nTime: 12:00 PM – 3:00 PM\nLocation: 412 Park A
 venue\, Corning\, NY\nLive Music & Food Trucks\nLive Beats: Rock out to a 
 live performance by Whiskey & Lace playing right on site!\nGreat Eats: Gra
 b some delicious local favorites from Ray's Food Truck.\nShow Off Your Rid
 e\nGot a classic beauty\, a custom build\, or just a seriously cool ride? 
 Bring it out! This is a casual car meetup—just park 'em\, mingle with fe
 llow car enthusiasts\, and enjoy the community vibes. All cool cars are we
 lcome!\nFun & Activities for Everyone\nMake a day of it! Park Avenue Sport
 s Center will have all of its classic attractions open and ready for actio
 n:\n18-Hole Mini Golf Course\nDriving Range\nBatting Cages\nCombat Laser T
 ag (by appt only)\nWater Wars (Water balloon game to cool off!)\nIce Cream
 !\nAdmission is free to attend and view the cars! Mark your calendars\, in
 vite your friends\, and we'll see you there!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - http
 s://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78429471/20260809120000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78429471/20260809120000
END:VEVENT
