  variety of local artisans and businesses.\nSweet Treats: Sample our pure\
 , local honey and enjoy fresh baked goods from our partners\, like Home Ma
 de Delights.\nBee Education: Learn about the vital role bees play in our e
 cosystem and how you can support them.\nFamily Fun: Activities for all age
 s to enjoy!\nWhere: 2981 NY-352\, Big Flats\, NY\nWhen: Saturday\, August 
 15\, 2026\nAdmission: Free and open to the public!\nVendors welcome! Regis
 ter at Honeybeemade.com or stop in our Gift Shop. 25 per Space/Vendor.\nCo
 me support local and celebrate the hard-working honeybee. We can't wait to
