DESCRIPTION:Event by Elmira Economic Opportunity Program\, Inc.\nSullivan 
 Park (Thorne Street Park)\nHorseheads\, NY\nPublic\nYour Summer Jazz Escap
 e.\nFour Hours. Three Acts. One Unforgettable Afternoon.\nWhat better way 
 to celebrate summer than live music\, friends\, and an afternoon of smooth
  jazz?\nJoin us for the 2026 Ferrario Elmira Jazz Festival on Saturday\, A
 ugust 15\, from 12 noon–4 PM at Thorne Street Park in Horseheads\, NY.\n
 This year’s festival features an incredible lineup of jazz talent:\nMari
 on Meadows ( @saxmar99 )\nBrian Simpson ( @brian.simpson.jazz )\nTop Shelf
  ( @Top-Shelf-1032460866778520 )\nWhether you are local to the Southern Ti
 er or making the trip from Rochester\, Syracuse\, Ithaca\, Binghamton\, or
  the Finger Lakes region\, this is a summer music event worth putting on y
 our calendar.\nVisit the website to learn more about the artists and festi
 val details and buy your tickets:\nhttps://www.ElmiraJazzFestival.com\nIt
 ’s More Than Music!\nAll proceeds and donations from the festival benefi
 t The Economic Opportunity Program\, Inc. of Chemung and Schuyler Counties
 \, helping EOP better serve individuals\, children\, and families througho
 ut the community.\nEOP serves more than 5\,000 people annually in the Sout
 hern Tier of New York through programs such as Head Start and Early Head S
 tart\, Literacy Volunteers\, Summer Feeding for children and adults\, afte
 rschool services\, weatherization services\, and more. EOP has been workin
 g in the community since 1965.\nSupport EOP\, enjoy world-class music\, an
 d be part of one unforgettable summer afternoon at the Ferrario Elmira Jaz
 z Festival.\nLearn more:\nhttps://www.ElmiraJazzFestival.com\n\nSource: FL
 Xcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78419972/2026081512000
 0
