BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Elmira Little Theatre presents Mel Brooks’ YOUNG FRANKENSTEIN
DTSTART:20260815T180000Z
DTEND:20260815T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20260809T201414Z
UID:6d76762ef977249b6598cb347a96ebfce73cb5ca@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Performing Arts,Music
DESCRIPTION:Elmira Little Theatre presents\nMel Brooks’ YOUNG FRANKENSTE
 IN\nBook by Mel Brooks and Thomas Meehan\nMusic and Lyrics by Mel Brooks\n
 Directed by Kaylara Allington\nMusic Directed by Nolan DeSanto\nin Powers 
 Theater\nFriday\, August 14\, 2026\n7:30pm\nSaturday\, August 15\, 2026\n2
 :00pm & 7:30pm\nSunday\, August 16\, 2026\n2:00pm\nAge Recommendation: Rat
 ed PG\nRunning Time: 2 hrs and 30 mins with a 15 min intermission\nPricing
 \nProcessing and facility maintenance fees apply.\nGeneral Admission Ticke
 ts:\nAdults: $35\nSeniors/Students: $30\nClemens Center Members: $28\nGrou
 ps of 6 or more – $28/person\nMel Brooks’ madcap comedy collides with 
 Mary Shelley’s classic monster tale in Young Frankenstein. Victor Franke
 nstein\, the mad scientist of legend\, has died and left everything to his
  grandson\, Frederick\, who wants nothing to do with the family’s notori
 ous legacy. To settle his inheritance\, he travels to his grandfather’s 
 castle in Transylvania\, meeting the grandson of Victor’s loyal henchman
 \, Igor\; the beautiful lab assistant\, Inga\; and the mysterious Frau Bl
 ücher. Before long\, Frederick is sucked into his grandfather’s experim
 ents and succeeds in creating human life. But by the time they realize tha
 t the Monster’s been accidentally given an abnormal brain\, the Monster 
 has already escaped\, seemingly set to terrorize the countryside like the 
 Frankensteinian monsters before him. Will Frederick repeat the mistakes of
  his grandfather? Or will he succeed where the others have not and turn hi
 s Monster into a dapper\, intelligent man about town? Young Frankenstein i
 s a hilarious take on the classic horror story\, combining zany antics\, a
  witty script\, and high energy comedic performances for one unforgettable
 \, hilarious adventure in Transylvania.\nDates/times/programs are subject 
 to change.\nTickets: https://clemenscenter.org/event/elmira-little-theatre
 -presents-mel-brooks-young-frankenstein/.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https:/
 /calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78373195/20260815140000
GEO:42.08921;-76.804956
LOCATION:Clemens Center\, 207 Clemens Center Parkway\, Elmira\, New York\,
  14901
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://clemenscenter.org/event/elmira-little-theatre-presents-mel-bro
 oks-young-frankenstein/
END:VEVENT
