UID:43b96e05345cb76b7bcb1193227509183b424f57@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music,Dancing,Community,Family Fun,New to the Area
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to groove every Thursday night in July and August at
  Music in the Square! From 6 to 8 PM\, Centerway Square in downtown Cornin
 g transforms into the ultimate summer hangout with live performances by ta
 lented local and regional artists.\nWhether you're planning a romantic dat
 e night or a fun family outing\, this event has something for everyone. St
 roll through the historic streets of downtown Corning\, indulge in delicio
 us eats from local eateries\, and shop ‘til you drop before settling int
 o the charming atmosphere of Centerway Square. Let the music carry you thr
 ough the perfect summer evening in the heart of our vibrant community.\nAr
 tist Lineup:\nJuly 9\nDelta Blues by Gerard Burke\nBlues Guitarist\nJuly 1
 6\nSalsa Libre\nTraditional & Contemporary Latin Rhythms\nBonus: Free Sals
 a Dance Lesson with Latin Dance by Sandra Roig at 5:00 PM before the perfo
 rmance.\nJuly 23\nThe Variables\nClassic Rock\nJuly 30\nKira & The Kindnes
 s\nRock\, Funk\, Soul & Blues Fusion\nAugust 6\nBetter Halves\nCarissa For
 d & Thomas Andolino / Acoustic Covers\nAugust 13\nTBD\nAugust 20\nLouiston
 \nFolk & Roll Band\nAugust 27\nDisco Line Dancing Party with Rosita Wright
  & DJ Mark Schmidt\nGet your 80s on! Do the Hustle and hit the dance floor
  for a night of disco favorites\, line dancing\, and high-energy fun in Ce
 nterway Square! Learn a few moves\, groove with friends\, and celebrate th
 e end of the Music in the Square season.\nMark your calendars\, grab your 
 lawn chairs\, and join us for an unforgettable season of music and summer 
 vibes!\nThank you to our Summer in Downtown sponsor\, Williams Toyota.\n\n
 Source: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78407994/202
 60709180000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78407994/20260709180000
END:VEVENT
