DESCRIPTION:Event by Atwater Wine\n5055 State Route 414\, Burdett\, NY\nDu
 ration: 3 hr\nPublic\nLiam Lawson is a guitarist and music educator based 
 in Ithaca\, NY.\nA seasoned songwriter\, he works in the “story song” 
 tradition of artists like Woody Guthrie and Gordon Lightfoot. Many of his 
 tunes retell actual historical events. Other tunes express the spirit of t
 he times with lyrics that are honest and hopeful.\nAs a guitarist\, Liam i
 s a fingerstylist in the tradition of Chet Atkins and Merle Travis. His st
 yle also borrows from jazzers like Joe Pass and Lenny Breau. Liam's live p
 erformances always include a few instrumental pieces - music for its own s
 ake\, showcasing his studied technique and deep knowledge of the fretboard
 .\nPlease join us for Liam's music\, wine by the glass or bottle\, cocktai
 ls\, mocktails\, cheese or charcuterie plates\, and small bites.\nIndustry
  and Club Discounts!\nWine & Cocktail Bar: 6:00-9:00 PM\nMusic: 6:00-8:00 
 PM\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/784199
 60/20260829183000
