DESCRIPTION:The Seeker’s Art Gallery\nFirst Fridays April Through Octobe
 r 2026\n5:00 PM to 8:00 PM\nSomething is waiting to be found.\nIntroducing
  First Fridays: The Seeker's Art Gallery\nA monthly art event tucked into 
 the heart of downtown\, where local artists\, live music\, and community c
 ome together under open skies.\nEvery first Friday\, April through October
 \, we're activating a hidden-in-plain-sight courtyard space alongside @lik
 eMagickPhotography and @TheCakery to bring you an evening of original art\
 , live music\, the occasional silent auction\, and good energy.\nFree to a
 ttend\, sober\, outdoor event\n5:00-8:00 PM April through October 2026\nTh
 e Courtyard at 116 Baldwin St Elmira NY\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://c
 alendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78369827/20260605170000
