DESCRIPTION:The Williams Toyota Wineglass 5K is celebrating its 15th year 
 running! This family-friendly 5K is a great warm-up event for anyone runni
 ng the full or half marathon on Sunday. It's the second race (of three) fo
 r those participating in the Riesling or Pinot Challenge. Runners will toe
  the start line for a flat\, out-and-back course that starts and finishes 
 near Corning Memorial Stadium at Corning Painted-Post High School. All fin
 ishers will receive a medal.\nRegister here\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https
 ://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78429484/20261003080000
