 me check out all the aircraft\, and learn more about the exciting world of
  aviation over a fresh\, hot breakfast!\nWhat’s included?\nPancakes\, om
 elettes\, eggs cooked to order\, breakfast sausage\, coffee\, and juice. A
 dults $12.00\, kids $6.00.\nCan’t make this one? These are held the firs
 t Sunday of every month May-October. Hope to see you there!!!\nEvent by EA
